blic/3bbmoql3c8/properties/74edfe52330211f186110660515b2fcd/w1600/35-03424f7ae52cfa326d8807a28548bbd1.jpg?v=1779949332","https://cdn.resales-online.com/public/3bbmoql3c8/properties/74edfe52330211f186110660515b2fcd/w1600/36-5481dce773b43582c3bf79f9c6226866.jpg?v=1779949332","https://cdn.resales-online.com/public/3bbmoql3c8/properties/74edfe52330211f186110660515b2fcd/w1600/37-7c8938eb4835f4a40f347690354a83a0.jpg?v=1779949332","https://cdn.resales-online.com/public/3bbmoql3c8/properties/74edfe52330211f186110660515b2fcd/w1600/38-eaf7d50c8a94485f6f7bbe0f9cb05753.jpg?v=1779949332","https://cdn.resales-online.com/public/3bbmoql3c8/properties/74edfe52330211f186110660515b2fcd/w1600/39-d6d0c795fba570369850bf7142d03556.jpg?v=1779949332","https://cdn.resales-online.com/public/3bbmoql3c8/properties/74edfe52330211f186110660515b2fcd/w1600/40-73c7fbc1d6997b08f7eaa7d72853815e.jpg?v=1779949332"],"descripcion":{"es":"Esta excepcional villa adosada se encuentra en una de las urbanizaciones más exclusivas de la Milla de Oro de Marbella. Recientemente reformada, la propiedad combina un elegante diseño mediterráneo con el confort moderno, creando una refinada casa de playa.\n\nLa planta baja presenta un luminoso espacio diáfano donde el salón, el comedor y la cocina totalmente equipada se integran a la perfección. Grandes puertas correderas dan acceso a un jardín privado diseñado para disfrutar del aire libre, con piscina climatizada, cocina de verano y elegantes zonas de estar y comedor.\n\nEn esta planta también se incluye un dormitorio de invitados con baño en suite y un aseo adicional.\n\nEn la planta superior, la propiedad ofrece dos suites más, ambas con vistas panorámicas al mar. La suite principal cuenta con vestidor y baño en suite, mientras que el segundo dormitorio tiene acceso a una amplia terraza con zona de estar y bar, ideal para disfrutar de las puestas de sol.\n\nLa propiedad cuenta con acceso directo al paseo marítimo, lo que permite llegar fácilmente a pie a destinos tan conocidos como Puente Romano, Marbella Club y Puerto Banús, así como a una amplia variedad de restaurantes, ‌clubes ‌de ‌playa ‌y ‌servicios.\n\nEsta ‌es una ‌oportunidad única ‌para adquirir una vivienda en ‌primera ‌línea ‌de ‌playa ‌totalmente reformada en una ‌de ‌las ‌zonas ‌más ‌cotizadas ‌de ‌Marbella.","en":"This exceptional semi-detached villa is located in one of the most exclusive beachfront communities on Marbella’s Golden Mile. Recently renovated, the property combines elegant Mediterranean design with modern comfort, creating a refined coastal home.\n\nThe entrance level features a bright open-plan layout, where the living room, dining area, and fully fitted kitchen flow seamlessly together. Large sliding doors open onto a private garden designed for outdoor living, complete with a heated swimming pool, summer kitchen, and stylish lounge and dining areas.\n\nThis level also includes a guest bedroom with en-suite bathroom and an additional guest toilet.\n\nUpstairs, the property offers two further bedroom suites, both enjoying panoramic sea views. The master suite features a walk-in closet and en-suite bathroom, while the second bedroom provides access to a spacious terrace with a lounge area and wet bar, ideal for enjoying sunsets.\n\nThe property benefits from direct access to the beachfront promenade, allowing easy walking distance to renowned destinations such as Puente Romano, Marbella Club, and Puerto Banús, as ‌well ‌as ‌a ‌wide ‌range ‌of restaurants, ‌beach clubs, ‌and amenities.\n\nThis is a rare ‌opportunity ‌to ‌own ‌a ‌fully renovated beachfront home ‌in ‌one ‌of ‌Marbella’s ‌most ‌sought-after ‌locations."},"features":{"es":["Primera línea de Playa","Lado de la Playa","Cerca de Tiendas","Cerca del Mar","Cerca de Ciudad","Sureste","Reformado Recientemente","Privada","Con Calefacción","Aire Acondicionado","Mar","Panorámicas","Jardín","Terraza Cubierta","Terraza Privada","Barbacoa","Cocina Comedor","Privado","Recinto Cerrado","Frente a la playa","Lujo"],"en":["Beachfront","Beachside","Close To Shops","Close To Sea","Close To Town","South East","Recently Renovated","Private","Heated","Air Conditioning","Sea","Panoramic","Garden","Covered Terrace","Private Terrace","Barbeque","Kitchen-Lounge","Private","Gated Complex","Beachfront","Luxury"]},"piscina":true,"parking":false,"jardin":true,"estado":"Available","gps":{},"energia":{"CO2Rated":"","CO2Value":"","EnergyRated":"","EnergyValue":"","Image":""},"gastos":{"comunidad":"7,188","ibi":"823","basura":"278"}}